@startuml
title ASII-26 - Cambio solicitado (Semana 12)
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
[Prototipo S11] as s11
[Pantallas nuevas\ninicio-comparado] as ui #Paleturquoise
[Contrato API\n(cambio compatible)] as api #LightYellow
[Dominio\n(regla existente)] as dom #LightBlue
s11 --> ui : se extiende
ui --> api
